{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>CourtTally 是一款專為羽毛球而設的記分應用，熟悉單打與雙打的發球權、發球區及輪換規則，你只需輕點得分一方，其餘交由程式處理。無論是一局、三局兩勝或五局三勝，都能即時顯示正確比分與發球位置，賽後更會提供文字賽事總結。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>自動追蹤發球權與輪轉</h2>\n<p>應用內建完整羽毛球計分規則，支援單打與雙打的發球權、發球區及輪換，並自動處理領先兩分、三十分上限與決勝局十一分換邊。手機放在場邊，比分從遠處仍清晰可讀，發球一方以框線標示。Apple Watch 版本是完整計分板，輕點或滑動即可記分。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-433-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-434-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-435-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-436-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-437-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：CourtTally</li>\n<li>應用類別：Sports</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T19:18:21.816989+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":303,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}